Cell["\<\
Here, l0 represents the mean anomaly of the inner binary, \[Omega]0 \
represents the argument of periapsis, \[CapitalOmega]0 represents the \
ascending node, L0 represents the mean motion,J0 represents the angular \
momentum, H0 represents the projected angular momentum\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.938506457589786*^9, 3.938506472461175*^9}, {
